RESEARCHER_FLINT_TRACE_JSON {"content": "<response>\n<analysis>\nTwo fresh-prompt full confirmations were completed for candidate L20E73N184P at factor 64. The first produced 7 target matches and zero control matches; the second produced 8 target matches and zero control matches. Both used eight fresh prompts, the goalkeeper regex, and included baseline, opposite-pole, and matched-neuron conditions. The candidate outputs were sometimes repetitive or incoherent, so the effect is suggestive but not yet clean.\n</analysis>\n<plan>\nInspect the final immutable lab call record to confirm the latest state and full confirmation counts before authoring the final study and report.\n</plan>\n<commands>\n<tool>\n{\"name\":\"read_lines\",\"args\":{\"path\":\"lab_calls.jsonl\",\"start\":1,\"end\":1}}</tool>\n</commands>\n</response>", "kind": "model_response", "step": 29}
